{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10199","headline":"承恩量移宰江邑临鄱江怅然之作 · 李嘉佑","name":"承恩量移宰江邑临鄱江怅然之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四年谪宦滞江城，未厌门前鄱水清。\n谁言宰邑化黎庶，欲别云山如弟兄。\n双鸥爲底无心狎，白发从他遶鬓生。\n惆怅闲眠临极浦，夕阳秋草不胜情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}